00:32:43.460 --> 00:32:47.940
And Ben Nugent, the character, was named after Mindy Kaling's

775
00:32:47.940 --> 00:32:52.340
real-life boyfriend, at the time, writer, Benjamin Nugent.

776
00:32:52.700 --> 00:32:57.300
I remember the register when I was watching this.

777
00:32:57.500 --> 00:32:57.780
Yeah.

778
00:32:58.020 --> 00:32:59.560
Oh, my gosh.

779
00:32:59.860 --> 00:33:00.240
Wow.

