786
00:33:18.080 --> 00:33:18.860
Cuckoo pants.

787
00:33:19.760 --> 00:33:20.640
I know.

788
00:33:20.860 --> 00:33:23.480
Could you imagine getting a call like that?

789
00:33:23.620 --> 00:33:24.060
No.

790
00:33:24.480 --> 00:33:27.220
And of course, Ben just shuts him down.

791
00:33:27.460 --> 00:33:30.900
He's like, yeah, I heard you're the guy that hit a woman with a car.

792
00:33:31.080 --> 00:33:32.640
Like, he's just not into it.

793
00:33:32.640 --> 00:33:36.200
