794
00:33:36.200 --> 00:33:36.760
It's cool.

795
00:33:36.900 --> 00:33:37.960
We're like the fun branch.

796
00:33:38.100 --> 00:33:40.720
And that's where that extended talking head would have come,

797
00:33:40.880 --> 00:33:42.460
where he breaks down all the branches.

798
00:33:42.980 --> 00:33:44.040
Oh, amazing.

799
00:33:44.760 --> 00:33:50.220
Michael and Dwight storm into the break room where the Finer Things Club is setting up.

800
00:33:50.400 --> 00:33:53.040
They have some Vivaldi playing in the background.

801
00:33:53.340 --> 00:33:54.700
The scene is so funny.

