814
00:34:30.860 --> 00:34:32.840
Paul is Toby just says, bow tie.

815
00:34:33.300 --> 00:34:34.500
It was so amazing.

816
00:34:34.840 --> 00:34:35.760
It was so good.

817
00:34:36.100 --> 00:34:41.160
Well, anyway, the purpose of this scene was that Dwight and Michael full on lie to Jim.

