00:34:51.860 --> 00:34:53.420
And Jim has to come with them.

821
00:34:53.900 --> 00:34:55.240
So off they go.

822
00:34:56.140 --> 00:34:56.440
Yeah.

823
00:34:56.920 --> 00:34:57.200
Yeah.

824
00:34:57.660 --> 00:34:58.920
So they're in the car.

825
00:34:59.840 --> 00:35:00.900
Jim notices.

