But Dwight grabs it and throws his phone out the window.

838
00:35:36.480 --> 00:35:36.820
Yeah.

839
00:35:37.460 --> 00:35:38.660
Throws his phone out the window.

840
00:35:38.900 --> 00:35:41.220
And also, Michael says, had to be done.

841
00:35:41.580 --> 00:35:42.140
Had to be done.

842
00:35:42.140 --> 00:35:43.060
I'm like, what?

