And yes, we had a follow car, which is a car that follows the actors.

850
00:36:02.060 --> 00:36:05.100
And they would have to stop and pick up that phone.

851
00:36:05.420 --> 00:36:05.880
Yeah.

852
00:36:05.880 --> 00:36:12.460
We had a fan catch from Doug Schmidt, who says, not a question, but when Dwight throws Jim's

853
00:36:12.460 --> 00:36:15.380
phone out the window, they are clearly on a four-lane road.

854
00:36:15.380 --> 00:36:18.600
But when they stop to find it, it's only a two-lane road.

855
00:36:19.000 --> 00:36:20.840
Look at you with your catch, Doug.

856
00:36:21.040 --> 00:36:21.480
You go.

857
00:36:21.820 --> 00:36:24.300
And another catch from Emily Ambris.

858
00:36:24.300 --> 00:36:29.140
At eight minutes, 45 seconds, when they've stopped to retrieve the phone, you can see

859
00:36:29.140 --> 00:36:33.300
