860
00:36:33.920 --> 00:36:36.160
Oh, that's a really good catch.

861
00:36:36.160 --> 00:36:38.480
So yeah, clearly in California.

862
00:36:39.420 --> 00:36:41.200
So they're looking for Jim's phone.

863
00:36:41.460 --> 00:36:42.580
Jim finds it.

864
00:36:42.680 --> 00:36:43.320
And he's like, you know what?

865
00:36:43.380 --> 00:36:44.140
I'm going to call a cab.

866
00:36:44.540 --> 00:36:47.340
And they're like, okay, well, you'll miss out on the pranks.

867
00:36:47.400 --> 00:36:48.040
And he's like, hold up.

868
00:36:48.120 --> 00:36:48.860
What are you guys doing?

869
00:36:49.020 --> 00:36:49.640
What do you have planned?

870
00:36:49.840 --> 00:36:51.180
And then Michael lists off.

871
00:36:51.320 --> 00:36:54.340
They have the warehouse uniforms, silly string.

872
00:36:54.920 --> 00:36:59.840
Dwight also has some gasoline and chunks of rubber to make stink bombs or real bombs.

873
00:36:59.980 --> 00:37:00.540
They don't know.

874
00:37:00.760 --> 00:37:00.940
Yeah.

875
00:37:01.120 --> 00:37:01.700
Could be badass.

876
00:37:01.800 --> 00:37:02.500
They don't know.

877
00:37:02.640 --> 00:37:03.600
It could be either one.

878
00:37:03.940 --> 00:37:05.540
And Jim's like, yeah, no, that's not happening.

