00:37:05.540 --> 00:37:08.760
So he makes a deal with them that he'll dress up in the warehouse uniform.

880
00:37:08.760 --> 00:37:10.820
By the way, the one he got was Madges.

881
00:37:11.380 --> 00:37:11.760
Yes.

882
00:37:12.040 --> 00:37:15.340
And that he will go with them, but no stink bombs or shenanigans.

883
00:37:15.740 --> 00:37:18.960
Yeah, this is the compromise that he makes.

884
00:37:19.160 --> 00:37:23.280
And from this talking head, it cuts to this silent moment in the car.

885
00:37:23.500 --> 00:37:25.180
Nine minutes, 45 seconds.

886
00:37:25.500 --> 00:37:29.680
The three of them in the uniforms with these ridiculous mustaches.

887
00:37:30.000 --> 00:37:31.740
It is such a funny cut too.

888
00:37:32.000 --> 00:37:33.700
It cracked me up.

889
00:37:33.700 --> 00:37:40.500
I have so much to say about these car scenes, but I think we should take a break and come

