00:37:44.800 --> 00:37:45.540
I have not.

893
00:37:45.540 --> 00:37:46.040
Have you?

894
00:37:46.320 --> 00:37:47.860
I thought about it real serious.

895
00:37:48.400 --> 00:37:50.480
I've peed on the side of a lot of roads.

