00:38:40.240 --> 00:38:41.280
What's that sound?

914
00:38:41.880 --> 00:38:46.120
Oh, that sound is Dwight peeing in a can in the backseat.

915
00:38:46.560 --> 00:38:48.700
And they freak out.

916
00:38:48.860 --> 00:38:49.940
They're like, oh, gross.

917
00:38:50.120 --> 00:38:53.840
And then Michael starts swerving and Dwight's like, you're making me spray.

918
00:38:55.080 --> 00:38:58.020
This scene is like so fun to watch.

919
00:38:58.020 --> 00:38:59.840
I was laughing so hard.

