00:39:00.120 --> 00:39:02.240
We got a lot of mail about this scene.

921
00:39:02.680 --> 00:39:09.140
One from Sadie K who says, when the guys were in the car, did they break a lot?

922
00:39:09.520 --> 00:39:14.060
Oh, Sadie, the bloopers from this scene are so worth it.

923
00:39:14.220 --> 00:39:15.440
You've got to watch it.

924
00:39:15.620 --> 00:39:16.880
They were cracking up.

925
00:39:17.060 --> 00:39:20.900
I mean, it's one of the like rare times where Steve could not keep it together.

926
00:39:21.280 --> 00:39:21.700
Steve.

927
00:39:22.020 --> 00:39:22.160
Yeah.

928
00:39:22.480 --> 00:39:23.820
Every time too.

929
00:39:24.400 --> 00:39:27.420
Rain would have to say, I think I cut my penis on the lid.

