00:39:32.840 --> 00:39:37.380
At the very end, Dwight goes, I cut a chunk out of my penis for nothing.

932
00:39:37.980 --> 00:39:40.560
Those guys could not get through it.

933
00:39:40.780 --> 00:39:43.860
They were like melting into laughter.

