00:40:10.220 --> 00:40:14.440
Well, Evan, I like your question because you've clearly been listening to Office Ladies.

945
00:40:14.440 --> 00:40:18.160
The mustaches are made by hair and makeup.

946
00:40:18.220 --> 00:40:19.540
So it's not a prop.

947
00:40:19.940 --> 00:40:25.640
And hair and makeup work together because it's hair, because it's a mustache, right?

948
00:40:25.740 --> 00:40:25.880
Yeah.

949
00:40:25.880 --> 00:40:28.860
But then it goes on the face and has to be applied to the face.

950
00:40:28.900 --> 00:40:30.900
So it becomes a makeup thing.

951
00:40:31.180 --> 00:40:35.180
So they just had a tray of a bunch of different mustaches.

952
00:40:35.180 --> 00:40:37.580
And yes, they got Greg's approval.

953
00:40:37.780 --> 00:40:39.360
They talked to Joss Whedon, the director.

954
00:40:39.360 --> 00:40:44.300
They talked to Mindy Kaling, and they picked the mustaches for each of these guys to wear.

955
00:40:44.580 --> 00:40:50.600
Hair and makeup would take photos of the guys with the different mustaches and then walk

956
00:40:50.600 --> 00:40:52.800
them over to the writer's room.

957
00:40:52.800 --> 00:40:55.060
And the writers and directors would look at it.

958
00:40:55.120 --> 00:40:55.880
I can't imagine.

959
00:40:56.160 --> 00:40:57.320
That is so funny to me.

